<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Messina loses Volvo franchise.</title>
<headline>Messina loses Volvo franchise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Messina Ltd said on Wednesday that its Premier Equipment subsidiary had lost the franchise to distribute Volvo construction equipment in southern Africa following a strategic decision by the Swedish group.</p>
<p>Messina said Vovlo had agreed to compensate the firm for the early termination of the franchise.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
